{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"53e28d17-4f29-4b00-af87-333e4175ea5a","status":"SUCCESS","response":"I have updated [scripts/deploy.sh](file:///tmp/h-OV2kmQ/scripts/deploy.sh) and documented the changes in [ANSWER.md](file:///tmp/h-OV2kmQ/ANSWER.md):\n\n- **Short TTL (`public, max-age=300`)** for HTML, JS ([src/booking.js](file:///tmp/h-OV2kmQ/src/booking.js)), and CSS files so browsers revalidate quickly after deployments.\n- **Long TTL (`public, max-age=86400`)** for static files in `src/assets/` (`logo.png`, `mark.svg`).\n- **Explicit `Content-Type` preservation**: Paired `--content-type` and `--cache-control` per extension when applying `--metadata-directive REPLACE` (alongside split `aws s3 sync` commands) so already-uploaded S3 objects get the new `Cache-Control` headers without being reset to `binary/octet-stream`.\n","duration_seconds":77.194369,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":27150,"output_tokens":1973,"thinking_tokens":0,"cache_read_tokens":73720,"total_tokens":29123}}}
